            "show_accordion_divider": false,
            "line_thickness": "normal",
            "accordion_heading": "Key Ingredients",
            "heading_style": "font-heading",
            "accordion_text": "<p><strong>10,000mg VERISOL® Marine Collagen</strong>: Patented and clinically proven to improve skin elasticity (up to 15% by 4 weeks) and reduce fine lines and wrinkles (up to 50% after 8 weeks).</p><p><strong>Cultavit®</strong>: Powerful plant-based B-Complex (B1–B12) for optimal collagen performance and vitamin absorption.</p><p><strong>Polyphenols</strong>: A powerhouse of antioxidants that reduce inflammation and assist in the prevention of collagen breakdown.</p><p><strong>Hyaluronic Acid</strong>: 150mg mighty moisture booster for skin and joints, holding up to 1,000 times its weight in water.</p><p><strong>Vitamin C</strong>: 100% RDI, supports collagen synthesis, boosts collagen production, and brightens skin.</p><p><strong>Vitamin D</strong>: Supports skin repair, immune health, and bone strength.</p>",
            "accordion_page": "",
            "padding_bottom": 0
          }
